---
permalink: /ui_kits/website/im-new.html
headline: Come as you are.
deck: >-
  Whether you've been going to Anglican churches all your life or this is the
  first time you'll step inside, we hope you'll find a warm welcome.
intro_paragraphs:
  - text: >-
      We hope you will find a warm welcome when you first attend Emmanuel —
      whether in the week or on Sundays. Please do introduce yourself to one of
      the welcomers or clergy; we'll be happy to tell you more about our
      congregation and community life.
  - text: >-
      Whilst we are proud of our Anglican identity, we are a very international
      community, with a number of different Christian denominations represented
      in our congregation.
  - text: >-
      To help each of us find a place in worship, we have a number of services
      of Holy Communion during the week and on Sundays. Don't hesitate to
      contact a member of the clergy if you'd like to learn more. Even better,
      just come and visit!
  - text: >-
      At our main Parish Mass you can expect a robed choir, acolytes and
      incense, with a team of servers who reflect the diversity of our
      congregation. Our said Eucharists are more simple, and Joyful Noise is
      more noisy! The thread that ties them together is Eucharistic-centred
      worship.
  - text: >-
      We are working hard to make Emmanuel an inclusive and welcoming space. The
      Church is accessible to wheelchair and mobility scooter users via the Bell
      Porch entrance. Disabled toilets are located at the back of the church.
      The Church has a hearing aid loop installed.
  - text: >-
      The vicar aims to meet new members of the congregation for a 1-1 meeting
      within six months of their arrival. Please contact her if you'd like to
      arrange a meeting.
callout_heading: Still have a question?
callout_body: >-
  Don't hesitate to contact a member of the clergy if you'd like to learn more —
  or simply come along this Sunday.
hero_image: /assets/cms/site-images/imnew-hero.jpg
featured_services:
  - slug: sung-eucharist
    body: >-
      Our main Parish Mass — a robed choir, incense and the fullest celebration
      of the liturgy. Children's &amp; Youth Church meet during term.
  - slug: healing-eucharist
    body: >-
      A quiet, simple, 30-minute service said according to the Book of Common
      Prayer — a reflective start to the week.
  - slug: joyful-noise-eucharist
    body: >-
      A lively, noisy celebration of the Mass for pre-school children and their
      families, with music led on the guitar. Does not meet during the school
      summer holidays.
access_cards:
  - eyebrow: ''
    title: Step-free access
    body: >-
      Both Emmanuel and St Cuthbert's are accessible for wheelchairs, with
      bathrooms for disabled access at both buildings.
  - eyebrow: ''
    title: Hearing loop
    body: >-
      Our sound system at Emmanuel is fitted with a hearing aid loop throughout
      the church.
  - eyebrow: ''
    title: Disabled access bathroom
    body: Disabled toilets are located at the back of the church.
---
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en-GB">
<head>
<meta charset="utf-8" />
<title>I'm New — Emmanuel Church, West Hampstead</title>
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1" />
<link rel="stylesheet" href="/styles.css" />
<style>
  * { box-sizing: border-box; }
  body { margin: 0; background: var(--paper); font-family: var(--font-sans); color: var(--ink); -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased; }

  .welcome-hero { height: 540px; }
  .welcome-hero .em-hero__content { padding-bottom: 72px; }
  .welcome-hero h1 { font-family: var(--font-editorial); font-style: italic; font-weight: 400; font-size: 110px; line-height: 0.92; }
  .welcome-hero h1 .ro { font-style: normal; }

  .intro { padding: 100px var(--gutter) 40px; }
  .intro .inner { max-width: 1320px; margin: 0 auto; display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 360px; gap: 80px; align-items: start; }
  .intro .lead-para,
  .intro .intro-body > p:first-child { font-family: var(--font-editorial); font-size: 30px; line-height: 1.32; color: var(--ink); font-style: italic; margin: 0 0 34px; letter-spacing: -0.01em; }
  .intro p { font-family: var(--font-sans); font-size: var(--fs-body); line-height: var(--lh-relaxed); color: var(--ink-soft); margin: 0 0 22px; }

  /* Flexible CMS sections */
  .sec__inner { max-width: 1320px; margin: 0 auto; }
  .sec__heading { font-family: var(--font-display); font-size: 44px; font-weight: 500; color: var(--navy); line-height: 1.02; letter-spacing: -0.015em; margin: 14px 0 0; }

  .sec--cardgrid { padding: 60px var(--gutter) 110px; }
  .sec--cardgrid .em-ornament + .sec-cards,
  .sec--cardgrid .sec__heading + .sec-cards { margin-top: 48px; }
  .sec-cards { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr); gap: 28px; margin-top: 48px; }
  .sec-card { background: #fff; border: 1px solid var(--line); padding: 38px 34px 34px; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 12px; transition: all var(--dur) var(--ease); }
  .sec-card:hover { border-color: var(--brown); transform: translateY(-3px); }
  .sec-card__eyebrow { font-family: var(--font-sans); font-size: 12px; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 0.18em; text-transform: uppercase; color: var(--brown); }
  .sec-card__title { font-family: var(--font-display); font-size: 24px; font-weight: 600; color: var(--ink); margin: 0; }
  .sec-card__body { font-size: 14.5px; line-height: 1.6; color: var(--muted); margin: 0; flex-grow: 1; }

  /* Icon-list layout (two columns, heading left, ticked items) */
  .sec--iconlist { padding: 96px var(--gutter); background: var(--cream); border-top: 1px solid var(--line); border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line); }
  .sec--iconlist .sec__inner { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 380px 1fr; gap: 80px; align-items: start; }
  .sec--iconlist .sec__heading { font-size: 44px; }
  .sec-iconlist__items { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; gap: 28px 40px; }
  .sec-iconitem { display: flex; gap: 16px; align-items: flex-start; }
  .sec-iconitem__ic { width: 40px; height: 40px; flex-shrink: 0; color: var(--brown); border: 1px solid var(--line); display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; background: #fff; }
  .sec-iconitem__ic svg { width: 20px; height: 20px; stroke: currentColor; stroke-width: 1.8; fill: none; stroke-linecap: round; stroke-linejoin: round; }
  .sec-iconitem__title { font-family: var(--font-display); font-size: 20px; font-weight: 600; color: var(--navy); margin: 0 0 4px; }
  .sec-iconitem__body { font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.55; color: var(--ink-soft); margin: 0; }

  @media (max-width: 768px) {
    .intro .inner { grid-template-columns: 1fr; gap: 36px; }
    .sec-cards { grid-template-columns: 1fr; gap: 16px; }
    .sec-card { padding: 24px 20px; }
    .sec--iconlist .sec__inner { grid-template-columns: 1fr; gap: 32px; }
    .sec-iconlist__items { grid-template-columns: 1fr; gap: 20px; }
  }
</style>
<link rel="icon" type="image/x-icon" href="/assets/favicon.ico" />
<link rel="icon" type="image/png" sizes="32x32" href="/assets/favicon-32.png" />
<link rel="apple-touch-icon" sizes="180x180" href="/assets/apple-touch-icon.png" />
</head>
<body>

{% include "header.njk" %}

  <!-- Hero -->
  <section class="em-hero welcome-hero">
    <div class="em-hero__bg" style="background-image:url('{{ hero_image }}');background-position:center 60%"></div>
    <div class="em-hero__scrim"></div>
    <div class="em-hero__content">
      <h1 data-editable="text" data-prop="headline" data-type="span">{{ headline }}</h1>
      <p class="em-hero__tagline" data-editable="text" data-prop="deck" data-type="text">{{ deck }}</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Intro -->
  <section class="intro">
    <div class="inner">
      <div class="intro-body">
        <div data-editable="array" data-prop="intro_paragraphs">
        {% for para in intro_paragraphs %}
          <p data-editable="array-item">
            <span data-editable="text" data-prop="text" data-type="text">{{ para.text if para.text else para }}</span>
          </p>
        {% endfor %}
        </div>
      </div>
      <aside class="em-aside">
        <div class="em-aside-card">
          <h4>Planning your first visit</h4>
          <p class="big" style="margin-bottom:16px">Sundays at<br />8:00 · 9:15 · 10:30</p>
          <p>Lyncroft Gardens, London NW6 1JU. Step-free access at the side entrance.</p>
          <a href="service-times.html" class="em-readmore" style="margin-top:4px">See all service times →</a>
        </div>
      </aside>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Featured services -->
  {% set services = featured_services | resolveServices(serviceTimes) %}
  <section class="sec sec--cardgrid">
    <div class="sec__inner">
      <div class="sec-cards" data-editable="array" data-prop="featured_services">
      {% for s in services %}
        <div class="sec-card" data-editable="array-item">
          <div class="sec-card__eyebrow">{{ s.days | dayLabel }} · {{ s.time }}</div>
          <h3 class="sec-card__title">{{ s.name }}</h3>
          <p class="sec-card__body" data-editable="text" data-prop="body">{{ s.cardBody }}</p>
        </div>
      {% endfor %}
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Accessibility -->
  <section class="sec sec--iconlist">
    <div class="sec__inner">
      <div class="sec-iconlist__head">
        <div class="em-ornament is-leading">Coming to Emmanuel</div>
        <h2 class="sec__heading">Everyone is welcome here.</h2>
      </div>
      <div class="sec-iconlist__items" data-editable="array" data-prop="access_cards">
        {% for card in access_cards %}
        <div class="sec-iconitem" data-editable="array-item">
          <div class="sec-iconitem__ic"><svg viewbox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M20 6L9 17l-5-5" /></svg></div>
          <div>
            <h4 class="sec-iconitem__title" data-editable="text" data-prop="title" data-type="span">{{ card.title }}</h4>
            <p class="sec-iconitem__body" data-editable="text" data-prop="body" data-type="text">{{ card.body }}</p>
          </div>
        </div>
        {% endfor %}
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- CTA -->
  <section class="em-callout">
    <div class="inner">
      <div>
        <h3 data-editable="text" data-prop="callout_heading" data-type="span">{{ callout_heading }}</h3>
        <p data-editable="text" data-prop="callout_body" data-type="text">{{ callout_body }}</p>
      </div>
      <div style="display:flex;gap:14px;flex-wrap:wrap">
        <a href="mailto:vicar@emmanuelnw6.com" class="em-btn em-btn--tan">Contact the clergy</a>
        <a href="service-times.html" class="em-btn em-btn--ghost-light">Service times</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

{% include "footer.njk" %}

</body>
</html>
